{"id":"057daf715bc20324","group":"27","path":"27/27-ex-quadraticmeanings.md","title":"DNF degree and real polynomial degree differ","display":"ex-quadraticmeanings — DNF degree and real polynomial degree differ","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-ex-quadraticmeanings","aliases":["27-ex-quadraticmeanings"],"display":"ex-quadraticmeanings — DNF degree and real polynomial degree differ","depends_on":["[[27-df-quadfunc]]","[[27-df-quadpb]]","[[27-df-pbdeg]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§5.1; §13.2; §13.6.1","source_statement":"Local distinguishing examples for the two quadratic notions","source_printed_pages":"203; 571; 594","source_pdf_pages":"227; 595; 618","verification_status":"proved-in-note-source-definitions-checked","local_review_status":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-ex-quadraticmeanings"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-ex-quadraticmeanings</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-quadraticmeanings — DNF degree and real polynomial degree differ"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"923be44c9742df37\" href=\"?note=923be44c9742df37\" title=\"27-df-quadfunc\">27-df-quadfunc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"db1311544a44ed95\" href=\"?note=db1311544a44ed95\" title=\"27-df-quadpb\">27-df-quadpb</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"476d67d753efdb3f\" href=\"?note=476d67d753efdb3f\" title=\"27-df-pbdeg\">27-df-pbdeg</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§5.1; §13.2; §13.6.1"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Local distinguishing examples for the two quadratic notions"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"203; 571; 594"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"227; 595; 618"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note-source-definitions-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_3\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_3\\)</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathbb B^3\">\\(x\\in\\mathbb B^3\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x)=\\max\\{x_1,x_2,x_3\\}\">\\(f(x)=\\max\\{x_1,x_2,x_3\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_2\">\\(g\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_2\\)</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in\\mathbb B^2\">\\(y\\in\\mathbb B^2\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(y)=y_1+y_2\">\\(g(y)=y_1+y_2\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuadFunc}_n,\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n,\\deg\">\\(\\mathrm{QuadFunc}_n,\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n,\\deg\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"923be44c9742df37\" href=\"?note=923be44c9742df37\" title=\"27-df-quadfunc\">27-df-quadfunc</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"db1311544a44ed95\" href=\"?note=db1311544a44ed95\" title=\"27-df-quadpb\">27-df-quadpb</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"476d67d753efdb3f\" href=\"?note=476d67d753efdb3f\" title=\"27-df-pbdeg\">27-df-pbdeg</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{QuadFunc}_3\\land\\deg(f)=3\\land f\\notin\\mathrm{QuadPB}_3\\land g\\in\\mathrm{QuadPB}_2\\land g(1,1)=2\\land g\\notin\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f\\in\\mathrm{QuadFunc}_3\\land\\deg(f)=3\\land f\\notin\\mathrm{QuadPB}_3\\land g\\in\\mathrm{QuadPB}_2\\land g(1,1)=2\\land g\\notin\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地反混淆例子。f 的 DNF 为 x_1∨x_2∨x_3，项长度均为 1；但其唯一实多线性展开是 x_1+x_2+x_3−x_1x_2−x_1x_3−x_2x_3+x_1x_2x_3，次数为 3。g 的实多项式次数为 1，但在 (1,1) 处取 2。依据两章定义构造，并非声称是原书编号例子。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-quadfunc","status":"resolved","id":"923be44c9742df37","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-quadfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-quadpb","status":"resolved","id":"db1311544a44ed95","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-quadpb]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbdeg","status":"resolved","id":"476d67d753efdb3f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbdeg]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-quadfunc","status":"resolved","id":"923be44c9742df37","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{QuadFunc}_n,\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n,\\deg$（see [[27-df-quadfunc]], [[27-df-quadpb]], [[27-df-pbdeg]]）。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-quadpb","status":"resolved","id":"db1311544a44ed95","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{QuadFunc}_n,\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n,\\deg$（see [[27-df-quadfunc]], [[27-df-quadpb]], [[27-df-pbdeg]]）。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbdeg","status":"resolved","id":"476d67d753efdb3f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{QuadFunc}_n,\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n,\\deg$（see [[27-df-quadfunc]], [[27-df-quadpb]], [[27-df-pbdeg]]）。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_3","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathbb B^3","display":false},{"tex":"f(x)=\\max\\{x_1,x_2,x_3\\}","display":false},{"tex":"g\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_2","display":false},{"tex":"y\\in\\mathbb B^2","display":false},{"tex":"g(y)=y_1+y_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QuadFunc}_n,\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n,\\deg","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{QuadFunc}_3\\land\\deg(f)=3\\land f\\notin\\mathrm{QuadPB}_3\\land g\\in\\mathrm{QuadPB}_2\\land g(1,1)=2\\land g\\notin\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_2.","display":true}],"bytes":1711,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-599","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-ex-quadraticmeanings|ex-quadraticmeanings — DNF degree and real polynomial degree differ]]"}],"outgoing":["923be44c9742df37","db1311544a44ed95","476d67d753efdb3f"]}